 "result_text": "I fixed the `tox.ini` problem in `nose2/session.py`, but I haven't run anything, including your `nose2 -c tox.ini --junit-xml` command or the test suite.\n\nIn v0.15.0, `Session.loadConfigFiles` only read a file as ini if its name ended in `.cfg`. It handled `pyproject.toml` separately and silently ignored every other file. Your `tox.ini` was never read, so the `[unittest]` plugin list never loaded and `--junit-xml` came back as unrecognized.\n\nNow `pyproject.toml` is parsed as TOML and every other file is read as ini, as before 0.15.0.\n\n`ConfigParser.read` skips missing files without error, so a config path that doesn't exist is still ignored quietly.",
